"The same code must appear on both computers:\n"
"\n"
"%(code)s\n"
"\n"
"Other branch: %(branch)s\n"
"Fingerprint: %(fingerprint)s\n"
"\n"
"Does the code match?"
msgstr ""
"Lo stesso codice deve comparire su entrambi i computer:\n"
"\n"
"%(code)s\n"
"\n"
"Altro ramo: %(branch)s\n"
"Impronta: %(fingerprint)s\n"
"\n"
"Il codice coincide?"

